# Components

- Co-locate a `*.stories.tsx` (CSF3) for every component; add `*.test.tsx` for
  logic-bearing or interactive ones.
- Dashboard: `<name>.tsx` (no `.client`, no `'use client'`). `@rpg/ui` / Next.js:
  `<name>.client.tsx` + `'use client'` when interactive; `<name>.tsx` when server-safe.
- Use design-token classes — never hardcode colors or font sizes.
- Accessibility is required: use `itAxe` for axe-only Vitest blocks (CI-only;
  local `FORCE_AXE=1` to opt in), Storybook axe-playwright on PRs, and no
  `eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y` violations; never suppress axe globally.

Detail: [packages/ui/README.md](../../packages/ui/README.md) and [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).
